.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro
**/.build-tmp
uploader/data
map-assets
docs
*.md
# Bootstrap secrets (DATABASE_URL / POSTGRES_PASSWORD). `COPY uploader/ .` and
# `COPY site/ .` run from this root context, so uploader/.dockerignore is inert
# here — mirror .gitignore's .env rules at every depth. (#111)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
